From jean at biostat.ucsf.edu  Thu Jun 26 10:46:12 2003
From: jean at biostat.ucsf.edu (Jean Yee Hwa Yang)
Date: Thu Jun 26 18:47:00 2003
Subject: [BioC] Spotted array analysis
